{"id":"2a3dd589d6e4050f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-theoretic-strength.md","title":"Proof Theoretic Strength","display":"df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-theoretic-strength","aliases":["72-df-proof-theoretic-strength"],"display":"df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]"],"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"local-comparison-definition","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local ordinal comparison using the explicit convention in 72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal; no source theorem number claimed","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"正式记录固定序数赋值下的预序与等价关系"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-theoretic-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-theoretic-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-comparison-definition"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local ordinal comparison using the explicit convention in 72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal; no source theorem number claimed"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"正式记录固定序数赋值下的预序与等价关系"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1,T_2\">\\(T_1,T_2\\)</span> are formal theories to which the proof-theoretic ordinal convention of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a> applies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_3\">\\(T_3\\)</span> 也在同一证明论序数约定的定义域；比较全过程不改变序数赋值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|\\le|T_2|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|\\le|T_2|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|=|T_2|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|=|T_2|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1,\\qquad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3\\Rightarrow T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1,\\qquad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3\\Rightarrow T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines the comparison relation; the underlying ordinal assignment is defined once in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a>.</li>\n<li>Equality of proof-theoretic ordinals is relative to that assignment convention and need not identify every aspect of two theories.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：直接由实际序数次序的自反、传递与反对称性。不从序数相同推出两个理论的全部证明转换或一致性句等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_1,T_2$ are formal theories to which the proof-theoretic ordinal convention of [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] applies","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This atom defines the comparison relation; the underlying ordinal assignment is defined once in [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T_1,T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_3","display":false},{"tex":"T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|\\le|T_2|.","display":true},{"tex":"T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n|T_1|=|T_2|.","display":true},{"tex":"T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1,\\qquad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3\\Rightarrow T_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_3.","display":true},{"tex":"T_1\\equiv_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nT_1\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_2\\land T_2\\le_{\\mathsf{pt}}T_1.","display":true}],"bytes":1925,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-strength|df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength]] · 本地比较定义"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength](72-df-proof-theoretic-strength.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-theoretic-strength|df-proof-theoretic-strength — Proof Theoretic Strength]] · 本地比较定义"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-theoretic-strength]]"},{"id":"57199c40d155f4ba","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-theoretic-strength]]"}],"outgoing":["fd52635f93837cdf"]}